# Reporter identity for vendor ticket drafts.
#
# Nothing here is included in reports, bundles or drafts unless
# TICKET_CONSENT=1. Leaving this file untouched is the safe default: drafts
# then state that identity was withheld. The sentinel never guesses or
# scrapes your name, LinkedIn or GitHub.
#
# TICKET_CONSENT=0
# FULL_NAME=
# LINKEDIN=
# GITHUB=
